  '软件默认无数据。「导入预设数据」载入内置示例数据（品系、蚊笼、记录与预警），用于快速了解软件功能；「删除预设数据」清空全部品系、蚊笼、记录与预警（两击确认），删除前建议先导出 CSV 备份。「备份所有数据」将 data/ 与 result/ 全部复制到安装目录 backup/ 下的时间戳子文件夹（桌面版）；浏览器预览模式则下载 JSON 数据快照。':'No data by default. "Load Demo Data" loads the built-in sample strains, cages, records and alerts for a quick tour; "Delete Demo Data" erases all strains, cages, records and alerts (double-click to confirm) — export CSV backups first. "Back Up All Data" copies data/ and result/ in full to a timestamped folder under backup/ (desktop app); in browser preview mode it downloads a JSON data snapshot instead.',
