  '常规饲养（本室默认）':'Routine rearing (lab default)','WHO 成蚊接触测定':'WHO adult susceptibility (tube) test','WHO 瓶测定':'WHO bottle assay','IAEA 伊蚊规模化饲养':'IAEA mass-rearing of Aedes',
  '27±2℃ / 湿度不限':'27±2℃ / RH flexible',
  '未连接。选择串口并点「连接」开始每 5 秒顺序轮询全部探头；无硬件时勾选「模拟读数」体验全流程。':'Not connected. Pick a port and click "Connect" to sequentially poll all probes every 5 s; without hardware, tick "Simulated readings" for the full flow.',
  '正在积累读数…':'Accumulating readings…','最近 ':'Last ',
  ' 个探头 · 每 5 秒顺序轮询 · 最近 ':' probes · 5 s sequential polling · last ',
  '实时曲线：连接后自动绘制最近 12 分钟各探头温湿度（实线 温度 / 虚线 湿度）':'Live chart: plots ~12 min of per-probe temp/RH once connected (solid = temperature, dashed = RH)',
  '产卵预计':'Oviposition due',
  '<b>1. 硬件准备：</b>USB 转 RS485 适配器一只（CH340 / FT232 等芯片，免驱即可），Modbus RTU 温湿度变送器若干（SHT 系列等，8-N-1，出厂从站地址一般为 1）。':'<b>1. Hardware:</b> one USB-to-RS485 adapter (CH340 / FT232 etc., driver-free) and Modbus RTU temp-humidity transducer(s) (SHT series etc., 8-N-1, factory slave ID usually 1).',
  '<b>2. 接线：</b>变送器 485A / 485B 对应接入适配器 A / B；多台变送器在总线上手拉手并联，各自需设置不同的从站地址（1–247）。':'<b>2. Wiring:</b> connect the transducer 485A / 485B lines to adapter A / B; daisy-chain multiple transducers on the bus, each with a distinct slave address (1–247).',
  '<b>3. 连接：</b>插入适配器，点「刷新端口」选择出现的 COM 口与波特率（与变送器一致，常见 9600），在「探头列表」逐一登记各探头名称与从站地址后点「连接」。':'<b>3. Connect:</b> plug in the adapter, click "Refresh Ports", pick the COM port and baud rate (matching the transducer, usually 9600), register each probe name and slave address in "Probe list", then click "Connect".',
  '<b>4. 监测：</b>连接后每 5 秒按从站地址顺序轮询全部探头（功能码 03，从 0x0000 读 2 个：湿度、温度，0.1 倍率；RS485 半双工不可并发）；实时读数卡片与曲线在「统计分析 → 环境分析」呈现（曲线展示最近 12 分钟各探头读数），超出阈值自动生成预警，监测读数留存 result/env_*.json（桌面版）。':'<b>4. Monitoring:</b> all probes are polled sequentially by slave address every 5 s (function 03, 2 registers from 0x0000: humidity, temperature, 0.1 scale; RS485 half-duplex, no concurrency); live readout cards and the chart appear in Statistics → Environment (the chart shows the last ~12 min per probe), out-of-range values raise alerts automatically, and readings are saved to result/env_*.json (desktop).',
  '<b>提示：</b>不同厂家的寄存器映射可能不同（部分型号温度在前），若温湿度显示对调请查阅所用变送器说明书；「标准限值模板」可一键套用 WHO 接触测定 / WHO 瓶测定 / IAEA 伊蚊饲养温湿度限值，套用后仍可在「预警阈值」中微调。':'<b>Note:</b> register maps vary by vendor (some models put temperature first); if temp and RH appear swapped, check the transducer manual; "Standard limit presets" apply WHO contact / WHO bottle / IAEA Aedes rearing limits in one click, and can be fine-tuned in "Alert Thresholds".',
  '补完 v3.1 既定计划':'Completing the planned v3.1 features',
