  '预计随时羽化：提前准备羽化笼、糖水与实验排期；羽化后转入成虫笼并记录阶段。':'Emergence due any time: prepare the emergence cage, sugar water and experiment schedule in advance; record the stage transfer once adults emerge.',
  '积温轨道与实际阶段推进不符：优先核对环境温度与水温（水温才是幼虫实际经历的温度），再排查密度、饲料与水质；积累已结束蚊笼后在「统计分析 → KM 生存曲线」本地校准 T₀/K。':'GDD track inconsistent with stage progress: first verify room vs water temperature (water is what larvae actually experience), then check density, diet and water quality; calibrate T₀/K locally via Statistics → KM survival curves after cages close.',
  '— USB 串口环境监测升级为多探头：同一 RS485 总线手拉手接入多台变送器（各自设置不同从站地址），「探头列表」登记后每 5 秒按从站地址顺序轮询全部探头（RS485 半双工 Promise 链不可并发），探头列表本地记忆；新增多探头实时温湿度曲线（最近 12 分钟窗口，左轴温度自适应 + 阈值带、右轴湿度 0–100%，实线温度 / 虚线湿度，各探头配色区分）；新增标准限值模板一键套用（常规饲养 / WHO 成蚊接触测定 25±2℃·80±10%RH / WHO 瓶测定 27±2℃ / IAEA 伊蚊规模化饲养 26±1℃·70±5%RH，套用后可在预警阈值中微调）；新增血饲-产卵日历提醒（FAO/IAEA：血饲后约 3 天产卵，按最近一次血饲记录自动推算预计产卵日并生成提示级预警，收集到子笼后自动关闭）；预警中心支持「提示」级样式。':' — USB serial environment monitoring upgraded to multi-probe: daisy-chain multiple transducers on one RS485 bus (distinct slave addresses), register them in "Probe list" and poll all probes sequentially every 5 s (Promise chain over the half-duplex bus), with the probe list remembered locally; new live multi-probe temp/RH chart (~12-minute window, adaptive temperature axis with threshold band, RH 0–100% on the right axis, solid temperature / dashed RH, color-coded per probe); new one-click standard limit presets (routine rearing / WHO adult tube test 25±2℃·80±10%RH / WHO bottle assay 27±2℃ / IAEA Aedes mass-rearing 26±1℃·70±5%RH, fine-tunable in Alert Thresholds); new blood-feed-to-oviposition calendar reminder (FAO/IAEA: oviposition ~3 days after blood feeding — the expected laying date is derived from the latest blood-feed record and raised as an info-level alert, auto-closed once a sub-cage is collected); Alert Center now supports the "notice" style.',
