  'CO₂ 偏高：优先通风换气（开窗 / 机械通风），核对饲养密度与人员进出；长期偏高建议接入 CO₂ 变送器联动通风。':'CO₂ is high: ventilate first (window / mechanical ventilation), check stocking density and foot traffic; for persistent elevation consider a CO₂ transducer linked to ventilation.',
  '连接 USB 转 RS485 适配器与 Modbus RTU 变送器（8-N-1；默认寄存器映射：0x0000 湿度、0x0001 温度，0.1 倍率），点「连接」后每 5 秒轮询全部探头；实时读数卡片与曲线在「统计分析 → 环境分析」呈现，读数超出阈值自动生成预警，监测读数留存 result/env_*.json（桌面版）。桌面版另支持 TEMPer 系列 USB 温度计直插（HID，免驱动）与 CO₂ / 光照度 / 负压扩展参数变送器（设备类型可选，起始地址与倍率可按说明书修改）。无硬件时可勾选「模拟读数」体验全流程。':'Connect a USB–RS485 adapter and Modbus RTU transducers (8-N-1; default register map: 0x0000 RH, 0x0001 temperature, 0.1 scale), then click "Connect" to poll all probes every 5 s; live readout cards and the chart appear in Statistics → Environment, out-of-threshold readings raise alerts, and monitoring data is saved to result/env_*.json (desktop). The desktop edition also supports TEMPer-series USB thermometers plugged directly (HID, driver-free) and extended-parameter transducers for CO₂ / light / negative pressure (choose the device type; start address and scale are editable per the manual). Tick "Simulate" to try the full flow without hardware.',
  'USB 串口监测读数':'USB Serial Monitoring Readouts','每 5 秒轮询 · 实时曲线':'5 s polling · live chart','前往接入':'Set Up Hardware',
  '连接与探头配置在「硬件 → USB 串口」页签；监测读数留存 result/env_*.json（桌面版）。':'Connect and configure probes on the Hardware → USB Serial tab; readings are saved to result/env_*.json (desktop).',
  'Brière 发育速率拟合':'Brière development-rate fit',
