  '线性回归（对比）':'Linear regression (comparison)',
  '— 饲养结果预测（积温模型 GDD）：新增发育预测模块（算法独立注册为 forecast v0.1，script/algo/forecast.v0.1.js）——① 蚊笼详情新增「发育预测」卡：线性积温模型（GDD = Σ max(0, T̄日 − T₀)，超过上限发育温度按上限截断）逐日累计笼环境温度有效积温，内置文献热常数按品系拉丁名自动匹配（埃及伊蚊 T₀=8.3℃/K=181.2 日·度、白纹伊蚊幼虫期 K=105.26 + 卵/蛹期假设补偿、斯氏按蚊 K=187.7/上限 38℃ 截断、尖音库蚊复合群雌雄均值），给出预计羽化日倒计时、积温轨道进度与实际阶段进度双轨对比；环境记录缺失日顺延前值、连续缺失超 3 天或无记录按 26℃ 假设计入并标注覆盖率；② 发育偏差预警：积温轨道进度与实际阶段推进（卵→成虫六级序）偏差超阈值自动生成预警（临近羽化 / 超前 / 迟缓，分提示与警告两级），并给出温度、密度、饲料、水质排查建议；③ 科研分析（生存分析页签）新增「预测参数校准」：同品系已结束蚊笼 1/D × 平均温度线性回归（发育起点 T₀ 与有效积温 K），有效样本 ≥6 笼启用本地校准并覆盖文献默认值，界面明示文献值/校准值来源；「羽化产量区间」：同品系已结束笼累积存活率 P10/P50/P90 分位 × 在养笼起始卵量的产量区间估计，样本 ≥10 批次才显示；④ 全部预测附带诚实脚注：相关性非因果预测、基于笼环境温度（幼虫实际受水温驱动）、文献热常数存在株间差异（±20–30%）、未纳入密度/饲料/水质等因子。':' — Rearing outcome forecasting (GDD thermal-accumulation model): new development-forecast module (algorithm independently registered as forecast v0.1, script/algo/forecast.v0.1.js) — ① Cage details gain a "Development forecast" card: a linear GDD model (GDD = Σ max(0, T̄day − T₀), capped at the upper development temperature) accumulates effective cage-environment degree-days daily; built-in literature thermal constants are auto-matched by strain Latin name (Ae. aegypti T₀=8.3℃/K=181.2 day-degrees, Ae. albopictus larval K=105.26 plus egg/pupal assumption compensation, An. stephensi K=187.7 with a 38℃ cap, Culex pipiens complex averaged over sexes), giving an expected-eclosion countdown and a dual-track comparison of GDD progress vs actual stage progress; days with missing environment records carry the previous value forward, and gaps over 3 consecutive days (or no records) are counted as a 26℃ assumption with coverage shown; ② development-deviation alerts: when GDD-track progress diverges from actual stage advancement (egg → adult, six stages) beyond thresholds, alerts are raised automatically (near eclosion / ahead / delayed, notice and warning levels) with temperature, density, diet and water-quality troubleshooting tips; ③ research analysis (Survival tab) adds "Forecast parameter calibration": linear regression of 1/D × mean temperature on closed cages of the same strain (developmental zero T₀ and thermal constant K), enabled at ≥6 valid samples and overriding literature defaults with the source clearly labelled; "Emergence yield interval": an estimated yield range from the P10/P50/P90 survival percentiles of closed cages of the same strain × starting eggs of rearing cages, shown at ≥10 batches; ④ all forecasts carry honest footnotes: correlation is not causal prediction, cage environment temperature is used (larvae actually respond to water temperature), literature thermal constants vary between strains (±20–30%), and density/diet/water quality are not modelled.',
  '— 感知扩展：① TEMPer USB 温度计直插（HID）：桌面版经自研纯 Rust HID 命令枚举 / 读取 PCsensor TEMPer 家族设备（免驱动、零 C 编译依赖），接入方式新增「USB 直插（HID）」，与 RS485 总线并存，读数同样进入实时曲线、阈值预警与 result/env_*.json 留存；② Modbus 扩展参数设备：探头类型由温湿度扩展为四类（温湿度 / CO₂ / 光照度 / 负压），寄存器起始地址与倍率可按设备说明书修改，CO₂ 超阈值自动生成预警；③ 继电器联动建议条：温度 / 湿度 / CO₂ 偏离阈值时在监测卡片区内联给出风扇降温、加热保温、加湿、通风除湿、通风换气建议（连续两轮命中同一组合才显示；仅作页内建议，不下发任何控制指令，不进预警中心）；④ 科研分析新增「Brière 发育速率拟合」：复用发育校准样本拟合非线性发育速率曲线 r(T) = c·T·(T−T₀)·(T_L−T)^0.5（对 (T₀, T_L) 做 0.5℃ 网格搜索、c 取过原点最小二乘解析解），与同样本线性积温回归 r² 对比呈现，样本 <4 个或温度跨度 <5℃ 时诚实拒绝拟合，r²<0.5 标记拟合较弱；算法独立注册为 briere v0.1（script/algo/briere.v0.1.js）。':' — Perception extension: ① TEMPer USB thermometer direct plug-in (HID): the desktop edition enumerates and reads PCsensor TEMPer-family devices via self-developed pure-Rust HID commands (driver-free, no C compiler dependency); a new access mode "USB direct (HID)" coexists with the RS485 bus, and readings flow into the live chart, threshold alerts and result/env_*.json as before; ② Modbus extended-parameter devices: probe types expanded from temp/RH to four classes (temp/RH / CO₂ / light intensity / negative pressure), with register start address and scale editable per device manuals, and automatic CO₂ alerts above threshold; ③ relay action-suggestion bar: when temperature / RH / CO₂ drift beyond thresholds, inline suggestions (fan cooling, heating, humidifying, dehumidifying via ventilation, ventilation for CO₂) appear in the monitoring card area (shown only after two consecutive hits of the same combination; page-inline suggestions only — no control commands are sent, not included in the Alert Center); ④ research analysis adds "Brière development-rate fit": reuses development-calibration samples to fit the nonlinear rate curve r(T) = c·T·(T−T₀)·(T_L−T)^0.5 (0.5℃ grid search over (T₀, T_L), c solved by least squares through the origin), compared against the linear GDD regression r² on the same samples; fitting is honestly withheld when samples <4 or temperature span <5℃, and r²<0.5 is flagged as weak; the algorithm is registered independently as briere v0.1 (script/algo/briere.v0.1.js).',
  '开发者':'Developer',
