  '当前筛选仅含 1 个蚊笼，KM 曲线为该笼的生存曲线；log-rank 组间比较与池化解读不适用，结果仅供该笼复盘。':'The current filter contains a single cage: the KM curve is that cage\u2019s own survival curve; log-rank comparison and pooled interpretation do not apply — results are for this cage only.',
