  '— 界面精修：① 全局去除「科研分析」前缀，功能区直接命名（如「KM 生存曲线 · 生命表」「Brière 发育速率拟合」），预警提示与脚注的指路文案同步改为「统计分析 → KM 生存曲线」「统计页签」等表述（历史更新日志条目保留原文）；② 生存分析 / 活动分析 / 环境分析三个页签新增「蚊种 → 蚊株 → 蚊笼」级联筛选：选项由实时数据生成（不从示例数据硬编码），上级选「全部」时下级列全，蚊笼选项显示「笼号 · 品系名 世代」，可按单笼定位分析；生存页单笼筛选时给出「单笼模式」提示（log-rank 与池化对比不适用），活动 / 环境页的 KPI、会话下拉、会话列表、昼夜节律图与环境图表全部按筛选结果计算；③ 生存分析界面重组：顶部筛选条 → 关键指标行（已结束蚊笼 / 覆盖世代 / 覆盖蚊种 / 累计羽化成虫）→「KM 生存曲线 · 生命表」主区（KM 曲线 + log-rank 注记 + 三个导出按钮、池化生命表 + R₀/T/rₘ/λ/DT 参数卡、预测参数校准、Brière 拟合、羽化产量区间依次以子卡片呈现，KM 图加高至 320px 并完善坐标轴与图例），CSV 导出格式与算法不变；④ 全新品牌标识：侧边栏、顶栏、关于页与浏览器 favicon 更换为「纯色徽章 + 蚊虫侧影」Logo（#333D7A 单色圆角徽章，白色蚊虫侧面剪影：口器、触角、翅与足等特征清晰可辨），Windows 应用图标（ico）同步重制；⑤ 关于页修正：英文模式下开发者单位信息不再重复两次（中文模式保持中英两行），关于 / 开发者 / 更新日志同级标题字重与字号统一。':' — UI refinement: ① the "Research Analysis" label is removed globally and features are named directly (e.g. "KM survival curves · life table", "Brière development-rate fit"); alerts and footnotes now read "Statistics → KM survival curves" / "the Statistics tab" (historical changelog entries keep their original wording); ② the Survival / Activity / Environment analysis tabs gain a cascading "species → strain → cage" filter: options are generated from live data (not hard-coded from the demo), a parent set to "All" lists all children, cage options show "ID · strain name generation", and a single cage can be pinpointed; the survival tab shows a "single-cage mode" note when one cage is selected (log-rank and pooled comparison do not apply), and the KPIs, session dropdown, session list, circadian chart and environment charts on the Activity / Environment tabs all follow the filter; ③ the survival tab is reorganised: filter bar → KPI row (closed cages / generations / species / adults emerged) → the "KM survival curves · life table" main section (KM curve + log-rank note + three export buttons, pooled life table + R₀/T/rₘ/λ/DT cards, forecast parameter calibration, Brière fit and emergence-yield interval as sub-cards; the KM chart is raised to 320 px with axis labels and legend), with CSV export formats and algorithms unchanged; ④ a new brand identity: the sidebar, top bar, About page and favicon switch to the "solid badge + mosquito silhouette" logo (#333D7A monochrome rounded badge, white side-view mosquito silhouette with distinct proboscis, antennae, wing and legs), and the Windows app icon (.ico) is redrawn to match; ⑤ About page fixes: the developer affiliation no longer appears twice in English (Chinese keeps both lines), and the About / Developer / Changelog headings share one weight and size.',
