  'v3.6 · 2026-11-12 发布':'v3.6 · Released 2026-11-12',
  '抗药性测定':'Resistance Assays',
  '抗药测定':'Resistance Assays',
  '抗药性测定（GB/T 26347 生物测定法）':'Resistance assay (GB/T 26347 bioassay methods)',
  '＋ 新建测定':'+ New Assay','导出测定记录':'Export Assay Records','开始测定（启动倒计时）':'Start assay (begin countdown)',
  '按 GB/T 26347《蚊虫抗药性检测方法 生物测定法》成蚊接触筒法流程组织：试蚊入筒 → 药膜接触 1 小时 → 移入恢复筒 → 24 小时记录死亡率。每筒默认 30 只（可调），对照筒 1 个；保存后自动倒计时，24h 死亡率录入后自动判定（98–100% 敏感 / 90–98% 需确证 / <90% 抗性；对照死亡率 5–20% 按 Abbott 校正，>20% 需重做）。判定口径为通例，正式报告请以标准原文与诊断剂量为准。':'Organised after the GB/T 26347 adult mosquito tube test: mosquitoes into tubes → 1-h contact with treated paper → transfer to recovery cups → mortality recorded at 24 h. 30 mosquitoes per tube by default (adjustable) plus one control tube; countdowns start on save, and mortality judged automatically once 24-h deaths are entered (98–100% susceptible / 90–98% confirmation required / <90% resistant; control mortality 5–20% is Abbott-corrected, >20% requires a repeat). These criteria follow common practice — consult the standard text and diagnostic doses for formal reporting.',
  '将自动建 1 个对照筒（同规格、无药膜）。接触 1h 后移入恢复筒，24h 后录入死亡率自动判定。':'One control tube (same lot, untreated paper) is created automatically. After the 1-h exposure, mosquitoes move to recovery cups; mortality is entered at 24 h for automatic judgement.',
