  '每张标签含 QR 码（载荷：MosqCare|笼号|世代，扫码即得关键标识）、笼号、品系与世代、起始日期。建议热敏不干胶或 A4 不干胶纸打印后剪裁贴笼；浏览器「打印」对话框中选择目标打印机即可。':'Each label carries a QR code (payload: MosqCare|cage ID|generation), the cage ID, strain and generation, and the start date. Print on thermal or A4 self-adhesive label paper and cut to fit; choose the target printer in the browser print dialog.',
