  '查看审计轨迹':'View audit trail','导出审计轨迹 CSV':'Export audit-trail CSV','状态':'Status','说明':'Description',
  '台账只增不改（append-only）：记录一经保存永久保留，以追加说明性备注纠正。单机软件无权限体系，「可归因」为操作者自报层级；对外表述为「GLP 数据完整性友好（audit-trail ready）」，不构成 GLP 认证结论。':'The ledger is append-only: once saved, a record is kept permanently and corrections are made via appended explanatory notes. A single-user desktop app has no permission system, so "attributable" reflects self-reported operators; describe the product as "GLP data-integrity friendly (audit-trail ready)" — not as GLP-certified.',
  '导出 .eln 数据包（ELN 互操作）':'Export .eln package (ELN interoperability)',
  '软件默认无数据。「导入预设数据」载入内置示例数据（品系、蚊笼、记录与预警），用于快速了解软件功能；「删除预设数据」清空全部品系、蚊笼、记录与预警（两击确认），删除前建议先导出 CSV 备份。「备份所有数据」将 data/ 与 result/ 全部复制到安装目录 backup/ 下的时间戳子文件夹（桌面版）；浏览器预览模式则下载 JSON 数据快照。「导出 .eln 数据包」按 .eln（RO-Crate）规范将台账 JSON 与全部 CSV 装箱，可导入 eLabFTW 等 ELN 或长期归档。':'The app starts empty. "Load Demo Data" imports the built-in example (strains, cages, records and alerts) to explore features; "Delete Demo Data" erases all strains, cages, records and alerts (double-click to confirm) — export a CSV backup first. "Back Up All Data" copies data/ and result/ into a timestamped folder under backup/ in the install directory (desktop); in browser preview it downloads a JSON snapshot instead. "Export .eln package" boxes the ledger JSON and all CSVs into an .eln (RO-Crate) archive for ELN import (e.g. eLabFTW) or long-term archiving.',
  '审计轨迹（append-only 台账）':'Audit trail (append-only ledger)',
  '台账只增不改：以下为全部记录的创建信息（新记录含操作人与创建时间戳；早期记录未含创建时间戳以「—」标示）。记录本体不可编辑，纠错以追加说明性备注实现。':'Append-only ledger: creation details of every record (new records carry operator and creation timestamp; earlier records show "—" where no timestamp exists). Records cannot be edited — corrections are appended as explanatory notes.',
