  'ZIP 模块未加载':'ZIP module not loaded',
  '— 合规与互操作：① 发育历期基准表：蚊笼详情新增「发育历期基准」卡，按品系拉丁名给出卵 / L1–L4 / 蛹各阶段参考历期区间（26±1℃ 文献通值）与本笼实际历期对比（基准内 / 偏快 / 偏慢标注），当前阶段超参考上限自动生成「历期异常」预警，与 GDD 偏差预警互补，附诚实脚注（株间与温度差异）；② 血饲供体字段：饲喂记录选「血饲」时展开供体信息（供体类型：活体动物-麻醉 / 束缚 / 镇静、人工膜血饲、离体抗凝血；供体编号；伦理批号），写入台账并在时间线与管理记录 CSV 中呈现；③ 蚊株 / 蚊笼标签打印：纯前端零依赖 QR 编码器（script/qr.js），「蚊笼管理」按当前筛选批量生成或单笼生成标签（QR 载荷 MosqCare|笼号|世代 + 笼号大字 + 品系与世代 + 起始日期），A4 3×6 打印版式，打印预览仅显示标签页；④ 抗药性测定（新页签，GB/T 26347 生物测定法）：按成蚊接触筒法流程组织——新建测定（来源蚊笼、药剂与浓度、处理筒 1–4、每筒默认 30 只、对照筒自动生成、接触开始时间）后自动倒计时（接触 1h、24h 判定期），各筒死亡率内联录入，24h 死亡率自动判定（98–100% 敏感 / 90–98% 需确证 / <90% 抗性；对照死亡率 5–20% 按 Abbott 校正、>20% 提示重做），到期未录入自动生成「测定待判」提醒，测定记录一键导出 CSV；⑤ 两性生命表模板导出：生存分析导出行新增「两性生命表模板」，生成符合 R 包 insectecol lifeTable_read() 输入规范的个体日记录 CSV（ID + 各阶段经历天数 + 成虫存活天数 + gender + 逐日产卵列，含示例行），说明笼级台账与个体日记录的方法学边界；⑥ .eln 导出：设置→数据与备份新增「导出 .eln 数据包」，零依赖 ZIP 装箱（script/zip.js）——ro-crate-metadata.json（RO-Crate 1.1 描述）+ 台账原始 JSON + 全部 CSV 导出 + 双语 README，可直接导入 eLabFTW 等 ELN 或长期归档；⑦ GLP 数据完整性层（GLP-ready）：设置新增「操作人与数据完整性」区——操作人姓名设置后新记录自动署名（by）并附创建时间戳（cat），审计轨迹查看器（全台账 who / when / what 倒序表）与审计轨迹 CSV 导出，ALCOA+ 九项自检清单自动评估（可归因 / 清晰 / 同步 / 原始 / 准确 / 完整 / 一致 / 持久 / 可获得），明示单机自报边界与「audit-trail ready」表述；全部新功能中英双语。':' — Compliance & interoperability: ① Development-duration reference — cage details gain a "Development duration reference" card comparing this cage\u2019s actual stage durations against literature reference ranges per stage (egg / L1–L4 / pupa at 26±1℃) matched by strain Latin name (in-range / fast / slow flags); an automatic "stage-duration anomaly" alert fires when the current stage exceeds the reference upper bound, complementing the GDD deviation alert, with an honest footnote on strain and temperature variation; ② Blood-feed donor fields — choosing "blood feed" in a feeding record reveals donor details (donor type: live animal anaesthetised / restrained / sedated, membrane feeding, anticoagulated blood; donor ID; ethics approval no.), written into the ledger and shown in the timeline and management-record CSV; ③ Strain / cage label printing — a dependency-free pure-frontend QR encoder (script/qr.js); "Cage Management" generates labels for the current filter (or a single cage from its detail page) with payload MosqCare|cage ID|generation plus large cage ID, strain and generation, and start date; A4 3×6 layout, and print preview shows only the labels; ④ Resistance assay (new tab, GB/T 26347 bioassay methods) — organised after the adult tube test: a new assay (source cage, insecticide and concentration, 1–4 treatment tubes, 30 mosquitoes per tube by default, automatic control tube, exposure start time) starts countdowns automatically (1-h exposure, 24-h judgement window), per-tube mortality is entered inline, 24-h mortality is judged automatically (98–100% susceptible / 90–98% confirmation required / <90% resistant; control mortality 5–20% Abbott-corrected, >20% prompts a repeat), an "assay pending judgement" reminder is raised automatically at the deadline, and assay records export to CSV in one click; ⑤ Two-sex life-table template — the Survival export row gains a "two-sex life-table template" producing an individual daily-record CSV conforming to the input schema of insectecol::lifeTable_read() in R (ID + days in each stage + adult survival days + gender + daily fecundity columns, with an example row), documenting the methodological boundary between cage-level ledgers and individual daily records; ⑥ .eln export — Settings → Data & Backup gains "Export .eln package": a dependency-free ZIP packaging (script/zip.js) of ro-crate-metadata.json (RO-Crate 1.1 descriptor) + raw ledger JSON + all CSV exports + a bilingual README, importable into eLabFTW or other ELNs or archived long-term; ⑦ GLP data-integrity layer (GLP-ready) — Settings gains an "Operator & data integrity" section: after the operator name is set, new records are signed automatically (by) with a creation timestamp (cat); an audit-trail viewer (whole-ledger who / when / what, newest first) and audit-trail CSV export; an ALCOA+ nine-item self-check evaluated automatically (attributable / legible / contemporaneous / original / accurate / complete / consistent / enduring / available), with the self-reported single-user boundary and the "audit-trail ready" wording stated explicitly; all new features are bilingual.',
