  '— 生产质量控制：① SIT QC 记录套件（可选记录项）：蚊笼详情新增「QC 记录」入口，三类可选 QC 项目写入台账并在时间线呈现（「分 / 辐 / 飞」条目）——性分离（分选方法、雄虫数、混入雌虫数；自动计算雌污染率与回收率）、辐照（辐照源 Co-60 γ / X 射线 / 电子束、标称剂量、剂量校验、辐照批次号）、飞行测试（测试个体数、24h 飞出数；自动计算 FAI 飞行能力指数，FAO 飞行测试圆筒口径）；蚊笼详情新增「生产质量指标」卡：羽化率（成虫 ÷ 蛹，口径与统计页一致）与三类 QC 最近值，附诚实脚注（可选记录项，未记录不代表未达标）；QC 记录并入蚊笼管理记录 CSV，并可单独导出「SIT QC 记录」CSV（含自动计算的派生指标）；② 翅长测量辅助（照片半自动测量）：蚊笼详情新增「翅长测量」入口——翅照片导入后按「① 标尺起点 → ② 标尺终点 → ③ 翅基 → ④ 翅尖」四点点击完成半自动测量，可选两点标尺标定（px/mm）后自动换算翅长（mm），未标定仅记录像素距离并如实标注；测量记录按蚊笼保存、列表管理与删除（两击确认），支持 CSV 导出（像素 / 标定 / 翅长 / 标定状态 / 操作人 / 创建时间戳），照片不入库（仅保存测量结果，避免数据膨胀）；③ 阶段特异热常数与密度因子（探索）：生存分析新增「阶段特异热常数与密度因子」卡——按 stage 记录切分各阶段日期区间，结合实测温度汇总平均历期与平均温（n≥3 阶段呈现），估算阶段热常数 K = 历期 ×（均温 − T₀）（T₀ 优先本地校准、退回文献值，附「不可跨品系外插」脚注）；密度因子以起始卵量为近似，给出密度 vs 卵→成虫历期 / 累积存活率的 Pearson r（n≥5，|r|<0.3 标弱，相关性探索非因果）；算法独立注册于 algo/stagek.v0.1.js（MosqStageK）；④ 侧栏「抗药性测定」更名为「抗药测定」（页面内名称与 GB/T 26347 标准引用不变）；全部新功能中英双语。':' — Production quality control: ① SIT QC record suite (optional entries) — cage details gain a "QC record" entry; three optional QC items write to the ledger and appear in the timeline (marked SS / IR / FT) — sex separation (method, males, contaminant females; female-contamination and recovery rates computed automatically), irradiation (source Co-60 gamma / X-ray / electron beam, nominal dose, dose verification, irradiation lot no.) and flight test (individuals tested, fliers at 24 h; Flight Ability Index FAI computed automatically, FAO flight-test cylinder); cage details gain a "production quality indicators" card showing emergence rate (adults ÷ pupae, consistent with the Statistics tab) and the latest value of each QC type, with an honest footnote (optional entries — absence of a record does not imply failure); QC records are included in the management-record CSV and can be exported alone as an "SIT QC records" CSV (with computed indicators); ② Wing-length measurement (semi-automatic, from photos) — cage details gain a "wing length" entry: after importing a wing photo, a four-point workflow (① scale-bar start → ② scale-bar end → ③ wing base → ④ wing tip) completes the semi-automatic measurement; optional two-point scale-bar calibration (px/mm) converts pixel distance to wing length (mm); without calibration only the pixel distance is stored and honestly labelled; measurements are saved per cage with list management and deletion (double-click to confirm), and export to CSV (pixels / calibration / length / calibration status / operator / creation timestamp); photos are not stored (measurements only, avoiding data bloat); ③ Stage-specific thermal constants & density effects (exploratory) — Survival analysis gains a "stage-specific thermal constants & density effects" card: stage date intervals are split from stage records, combined with measured temperatures to summarise mean duration and mean temperature per stage (shown for n≥3), and stage thermal constant K = duration × (mean temp − T₀) estimated (T₀ prefers the local calibration value, falls back to literature, with a "do not extrapolate across strains" footnote); density effects are probed with initial egg counts as the proxy, reporting Pearson r for density vs egg-to-adult duration and vs cumulative survival (n≥5, |r|<0.3 flagged weak, correlation not causation); the algorithm is registered independently in algo/stagek.v0.1.js (MosqStageK); ④ The sidebar "抗药性测定" (Resistance Assays) is renamed "抗药测定" (in-page names and GB/T 26347 references unchanged); all new features are bilingual.',
