  '演示权重已随软件内置，点「载入内置演示模型」即可跑通流程（COCO 通用预训练，不识别蚊虫，仅验证识别流程，计数不可写入台账）；蚊虫计数领域模型不入库不随软件分发：请自行训练 .onnx 权重并在此本地导入、用途选「蚊虫计数领域模型」方可预填计数。推理运行时随软件本地分发（vendor/ort/），全部计算在本机完成，无网络通信。模型与会话仅驻内存，重启软件后需重新载入。仅支持 YOLOv10 系 NMS-free 输出（[1,300,6]）的模型。阈值修改即时生效，仅影响此后识别；阈值低于设定值的检出不计入预填。':'A demo weight is bundled with the app — click "Load built-in demo model" to run the pipeline (generic COCO pre-trained; it does not recognise mosquitoes, only validates the detection flow, and counts cannot be recorded); mosquito-counting domain models are not bundled: train your own .onnx weights, import them locally here and choose "Mosquito-counting domain model" as the purpose to enable count prefill. The inference runtime is bundled locally (vendor/ort/) — all computation happens on this machine with no network communication. Models and sessions live in memory only and must be re-loaded after restart. Only YOLOv10-family NMS-free output ([1,300,6]) models are supported. Threshold changes take effect immediately and only affect subsequent detections; detections below the threshold are excluded from prefill.',
