  '照片计数（智能感知 · 实验性）':'Photo Counting (Smart Sensing · Experimental)',
  '未加载图像：点击上方按钮导入照片（培养皿 / 卵板俯拍为宜）。图像仅在本机识别，不入库不上传。':'No image loaded: import a photo above (top-down dish / ovitrap paper works best). Images are analysed on this machine only — never stored or uploaded.',
  '未加载模型：请先在侧栏「模型」页载入 .onnx 模型。':'No model loaded — load or import an .onnx model on the "Models" page in the sidebar first.',
  '开始识别':'Run Detection','识别中…':'Detecting…','清除照片':'Clear photo',
