  '诚实边界：仅「蚊虫计数领域模型」可预填计数；AI 输出只是草稿，数量经人工核对并确认后才写入台账（记录标注「AI 预填 · 人工确认」）。当前仅支持 YOLOv10 系 NMS-free 输出（[1,300,6]）的模型。':'Honesty boundary: only a mosquito-counting domain model may prefill counts; AI output is a draft — the number is written to the ledger only after human review and confirmation (marked "AI-prefilled · human-confirmed"). Only YOLOv10-family NMS-free models ([1,300,6]) are supported.',
  '演示管线：当前为通用预训练模型（COCO 类别），不识别蚊虫；检出框仅用于验证识别流程，计数不可写入台账。':'Demo pipeline: the current model is a generic pre-trained model (COCO classes) and does not recognise mosquitoes; boxes only validate the pipeline — the count cannot be written to the ledger.',
